
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Versatile - Shop Near You, Sell Globally</title>
<link rel="icon" href="PREMIUM-CIRCLE-ICON.png">
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@700;900&display=swap');
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif}
body{background:#f8fafc}
header{background:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 20px;position:sticky;top:0}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.brand img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;padding:3px}
.brand span{color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:22px}
nav a{color:#cbd5e1;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;margin-left:16px;font-size:14px}
.hero{background:radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 50% -20%, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 70%);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:72px 20px 64px}
.hero-icon{width:120px;height:120px;background:#fff;border-radius:28px;padding:12px;margin:0 auto 22px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)}
.hero h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.2px}
.hero h1 span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#60a5fa,#2dd4bf,#fb923c,#a78bfa);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
.hero p{color:#94a3b8;margin:18px auto 0;max-width:520px;font-size:16px}
.btns{margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
.primary{background:#fff;color:#0f172a}
.secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:16px;padding:28px 20px;max-width:1050px;margin:0 auto}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:20px;padding:22px}
.card p{color:#64748b;font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="brand">
    <img src="PREMIUM-CIRCLE-ICON.png" alt="Versatile">
    <span>Versatile</span>
  </div>
  <nav><a href="#">Marketplace</a><a href="#">Learn</a><a href="#">Login</a></nav>
</header>
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-icon"><img src="PREMIUM-CIRCLE-ICON.png" style="width:100%"></div>
  <h1>Shop near you,<br><span>sell globally</span></h1>
  <p>All-in-one Marketplace • Global Chat • Education • Clean • Colorful • Trustworthy • Modern</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn primary" href="#">Start Selling →</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#">Explore Products</a></div>
</div>
<div class="grid">
  <div class="card"><h3>🛒 Marketplace</h3><p>Buy and sell anything locally and globally with verified sellers.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>💬 Global Chat</h3><p>Real-time translation chat worldwide.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>📚 Education</h3><p>Learn skills to grow your business.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>🤝 Community</h3><p>Trusted community and secure payments.</p></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>